            "description": "# Dune Query Translator\n\nA library we use in the Dune app to translate Dune queries from PostgreSQL and Spark SQL to DuneSQL.\n\nWe first use [SQLGlot](https://github.com/tobymao/sqlglot) to transpile the query.\nWe then pass the query through some handwritten rules for additional changes.\n\nInstall with\n\n```\npip install dune-query-translator\n```\n\n## Development\n\nInstall with\n\n```\npoetry install\n```\n\nTo make sure the Ruff linter will be happy, run\n```\npoetry run black .\npoetry run ruff .\n```\n\nTODO: Add a `CONTRIBUTING.md` file.\n\nRun tests with\n\n```\npoetry run pytest\n```\n\nWe test on examples in the `sqlglot_test_cases` directory.\nTo force an update of the expected outputs, do\n\n```\npoetry run python tests/update_expected_outputs.py\n```\n",
